{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55334","headline":"效胡峤饮茶诗 · 陶彝之","name":"效胡峤饮茶诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生凉好唤鸡苏佛，回味宜称橄榄仙。\n（同前。\n）（按：《清异录》一书，题陶谷撰，今人指出书中部分内容爲陶谷身後事，因疑非其所撰。\n今检全书，可断定出自宋初人之手，颇疑陶谷本有此稿，後人整理时又夹杂入其他内容。\n自游士藻以下九人事迹无考，其生活时代，大致可确定在五代至宋初之十数年间，故统附於此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶彝之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}